  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545571/description_3c124d25-a9d0-4c48-baf2-8445fe0b8109.png\" alt=\"隨機化器橫幅\" width=\"850\" height=\"300\"><a style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13)\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kanezyplays/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/My-Modpacks-important?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=important\" alt=\"\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/KanezyPlays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"></a><img src=\"https://cdn.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝咖啡\" width=\"114\" height=\"29\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🎲 隨機化器整合包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">每個方塊。每次製作。純粹的混亂。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">隨機化器整合包徹底顛覆了《Minecraft》的玩法。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">一切無法預測。沒有任何安全保障。一切都是隨機的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">挖掘方塊？你不會得到你預期的東西。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">製作物品？配方可能完全不一樣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">打開箱子？準備好迎接混亂吧。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">這個整合包使用了強大的隨機化系統，自動包含原版與模組物品，也就是說，安裝的模組越多，你的遊戲體驗就越瘋狂、越不可預測。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\">如果有問題請在下面留言。</span></strong></em></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong>僅支援 Forge / 需要 Forge</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p>_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545571/description_57b00c03-e7b0-409a-81f4-33aacd8cd521.png\" alt=\"功能特色\" width=\"847\" height=\"121\"></span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🔀 哪些東西會被隨機化？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">⛏️ 方塊掉落 &ndash; 泥土可能會掉落鑽石&hellip;或更糟的東西</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🎒 物品 &ndash; 來自原版與模組內容</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🧟 生物掉落 &ndash; 每次擊殺都是未知</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">📦 箱子戰利品 &ndash; 探索永遠充滿風險</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🧱 建築結構 &ndash; 隨機生成，打造狂野世界</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🧬 生物生成 &ndash; 做好面對意外的準備</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🧪 製作配方 &ndash; 沒有任何東西會以相同方式重複製作</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">是的 &mdash; 模組方塊、物品、生物和配方也會被完全隨機化。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">⚠️ 重要資訊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">兩次挖掘同一個方塊，絕對不會得到相同的物品</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">基岩、泥土、礦石 &mdash; 一切都遵循相同的隨機規則</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">支援單人遊戲與多人伺服器</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">請確保伺服器使用正確的整合包版本</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🎥 友善內容創作者</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">允許用於整合包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">允許用於 YouTube 影片與直播</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">需要標註來源（連結至該模組/整合包頁面）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">適合：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">挑戰模式</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">極限混亂世界</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">與朋友一起玩 SMP</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">內容創作</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🎯 適合誰？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">如果你已經厭倦了普通的進度推進，並且想要：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">不可預測的玩法</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">高重玩價值</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">純粹的混亂與歡笑</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">每個世界都有全新的 Minecraft 體驗</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">那麼這個整合包就是為你準備的。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">&nbsp;_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">🎲 隨機化器整合包</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">沒有任何平衡性可言。一切皆有可能。</span></p>\n<p>_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252frandomizermodpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545571/description_87a151e6-934c-4876-83e8-223199cc9f05.png\" alt=\"KANEZY\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<p>_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">來 MODRINTH 看看我的新整合包！！</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fkanemc_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545571/description_7e884fe2-d847-4051-a475-7971cab22f11.png\" alt=\"A Fine MC\" width=\"251\" height=\"251\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/545571/description_3781a261-6d4d-46bf-a60b-72279ba28053.png\" alt=\"Nightmare Realms\" width=\"251\" height=\"251\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
